                                "sense_id": "6a70f54d-564c-3181-8e33-5746df47714d",
                                "text": "In behalf of the dignity of whaling, I would fain advance naught but substantiated facts. But after embattling his facts, an advocate who should wholly suppress a not unreasonable surmise, which might tell eloquently upon his cause — such an advocate, would he not be blameworthy ?"
